XIO ASSEMBLER INTERFACE
VERSION 0.1

INPUT
    target assembly
    target architecture
    target ABI

OUTPUT
    XIO object

STAGES
    source
    lexical_scan
    mnemonic_resolution
    operand_parse
    instruction_validation
    encoding
    relocation_generation
    section_emission
    symbol_emission
    object_generation

DIRECTIVES
    .text
    .rodata
    .data
    .bss
    .section
    .global
    .local
    .weak
    .type
    .size
    .align
    .balign
    .byte
    .word
    .long
    .quad
    .zero
    .string
    .ascii
    .globl
    .extern

LABEL
    identifier :

OPERANDS
    register
    immediate
    memory
    label
    symbol
    displacement
    indexed
    scaled

VALIDATION
    mnemonic exists
    operand count valid
    operand types valid
    register valid
    immediate range valid
    addressing mode valid
    target feature enabled

ASSEMBLER MUST
    never silently change instructions
    never silently truncate values
    preserve relocation information
    reject invalid architecture
    emit deterministic objects
